{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part visual novel, part choose-your-own-adventure, <strong>Witchlight Woods</strong> immerses you in a strange, creepy, and dangerous adventure.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the youngest woman of your village, you are sent into the depths of the woods to perform the annual ritual that keeps the <strong>Thousand-Eyed Witch</strong> imprisoned. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed only with your courage and your <strong>magic lantern</strong>, face the dangers of the forest and the witch's tricks, uncover the secrets of the past, and perhaps even find yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913130/extras/52519d680ba8af36a8136be78734c9d5.poster.avif?t=1760004180\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913130/extras/52519d680ba8af36a8136be78734c9d5.webm?t=1760004180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A thousand eyes upon you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stalking you throughout your journey, the <strong>Thousand-Eyed Witch\u00a0</strong>will do everything in her power to stop you.\u00a0Sometimes <strong>charming</strong>, sometimes <strong>frightening</strong>, she will force you to make difficult choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Counter her schemes, see through her illusions, and converse with her to uncover her past and that of your village... But it will be up to you to discern truth from lies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friends or foes?</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet and bond with creatures and travelers roaming the woods, each with their own agenda. Decide who to help, who to use, and who to betray.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>By the light of my lantern.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only your lantern shields you from the witch\u2019s influence. Every drop of oil counts, and hard choices may earn you some, or cost you everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Conserve your oil, trade it, or burn it to cast spells. It\u2019s up to you to manage this precious resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913130/extras/a27e7e0bcb6332fc943bb9ccac1da708.poster.avif?t=1760004180\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913130/extras/a27e7e0bcb6332fc943bb9ccac1da708.webm?t=1760004180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the forest &amp; meet strange travelers and creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices that will deeply impact your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the oil in your lantern: your life depends on it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light RPG elements and spellcasting make every encounter unpredictable</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror tale tackling mature themes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bizarre and colorful hand-drawn visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous secrets and encounters to unlock</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3913130?t=1760004180","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913130/0d00248e3b1be2