class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the oil in your lantern: your life depends on it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light RPG elements and spellcasting make every encounter unpredictable</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror tale tackling mature themes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bizarre and colorful hand-drawn visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous secrets and encounters to unlock</p></li></ul>","developers":["Delphin Casado"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913130/0d0a829e0498ba29b40a4bf581b81e5ee5ef87ec/header.jpg?t=1760004180","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3913130/691428005/33c75e98620297abb6df4f948723bdd2639b72b6/1759924198/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760004178","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3913130/691428005/33c75e98620297abb6df4f948723bdd2639b72b6/1759924198/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760004178","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3913130/691428005/33c75e98620297abb6df4f948723bdd2639b72b6/1759924198/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760004178","id":257214213,"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257214213/16fe744334dd25d9f5c5b474e06765c89808aa86/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760004178"}],"name":"Witchlight Woods","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz 64-bit Intel-compatible<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2.0  GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0 or Dire